From ebc4a28a66b9ceca6a2589ee20e51f345a101439 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Artemenchuk <artes@alohabrowser.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 12:59:13 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] contrib: ffmpeg: enable avfilter / avdevice / swresample /
 filters / bsfs for monolith consumers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

iOS monolith static builds link both VLCKit's bundled FFmpeg and a
separate Modules/FFmpeg's libav*.xcframework (driven by ffmpegkit's
~470 undefined _av_* external refs from libffmpegkit_la-fftools_*.o).

The two FFmpeg copies with different ABIs cause runtime EXC_BAD_ACCESS
at av_log on swscale OpenScaler in libvlc's thumbnail thread.

To unify on VLCKit's bundled FFmpeg, the consumer drops Modules/FFmpeg
libav* deps + force_loads VLCKit so all libvlc + ffmpegkit refs bind
to VLCKit's own FFmpeg. But VLCKit's iphoneos build strips
libavfilter / libavdevice / libswresample which ffmpegkit needs:
- libavfilter: _av_buffersink_*, _av_buffersrc_*, _avfilter_* (~43)
- libavdevice: _avdevice_* (~6)
- libswresample: _swr_*, _swresample_* (~5)
- filters + bsfs (concat protocol, aac_adtstoasc bsf, etc.) needed
  by ffmpegkit's CLI tools for MP4 concat in StreamRecording.

Enabling these in ffmpeg's contrib build adds ~20-30 MB to VLCKit
but removes ~60 MB of duplicate libav* from Modules/FFmpeg — net
binary size impact is approximately neutral or slightly negative.

Refs: AlohaBrowser/aloha-browser-ios feature/CU-86eq9n2ta_vlc-kit.
---
 contrib/src/ffmpeg/rules.mak | 15 ++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/contrib/src/ffmpeg/rules.mak b/contrib/src/ffmpeg/rules.mak
index 7ebc37dab1..bf456509bb 100644
--- a/contrib/src/ffmpeg/rules.mak
+++ b/contrib/src/ffmpeg/rules.mak
@@ -24,16 +24,17 @@ FFMPEGCONF = --prefix="$(PREFIX)" --enable-static --disable-shared \
 	--enable-libgsm \
 	--enable-libopenjpeg \
 	--disable-debug \
-	--disable-avdevice \
-	--disable-devices \
-	--disable-avfilter \
-	--disable-filters \
-	--disable-protocol=concat \
-	--disable-bsfs \
+	--enable-avdevice \
+	--disable-indevs \
+	--disable-outdevs \
+	--enable-avfilter \
+	--enable-filters \
+	--enable-protocol=concat \
+	--enable-bsfs \
 	--disable-bzlib \
 	--disable-libvpx \
 	--enable-bsf=vp9_superframe \
-	--disable-swresample \
+	--enable-swresample \
 	--disable-iconv \
 	--disable-avisynth \
 	--disable-nvenc \
-- 
